        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Nickow, Oreopoulos and Quan (2020) report stronger average effects among earlier grades. The comparison spans different subjects, programs and study settings and does not identify one universal grade cutoff.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
